WEBVTT

00:03:28.450 --> 00:03:30.077
I have XY chromosomes.

00:03:30.101 --> 00:03:33.455
If my DNA is found
at the scene of a crime --

00:03:33.479 --> 00:03:35.988
not saying it will,
but, you know, we'll see.

00:03:36.012 --> 00:03:37.772
(Laughter)

00:03:37.796 --> 00:03:41.886
If my skeleton is discovered
thousands of years from now,

00:03:41.910 --> 00:03:43.310
I'll be labeled male.

00:03:44.125 --> 00:03:45.325
Is that the truth?

00:03:45.990 --> 00:03:47.457
My balls would say so.

00:03:48.093 --> 00:03:49.871
But what about the rest of me?

00:03:50.617 --> 00:03:54.926
And what if a woman has ovarian cancer
and has to have her ovaries removed?

00:03:54.950 --> 00:03:56.961
Does she still qualify as a woman?

00:03:57.609 --> 00:04:01.085
What about other intersex people
who are born without balls or ovaries